 money."}]},{"id":39251,"number":6,"name":"Forgive, Maybe. Forget, Never.","plot":"A light at the end of the tunnel emerges as Alesha, Gus and Wanda finally get Stephen’s safe open, though Alesha is baffled by what she finds. On the back of Alesha’s discovery, Claudia rushes home. Together with Simon, Nina confronts Oyin. With the thief revealed, Nina goes after the culprit. Simon and Nina review Stephen’s will, while Maureen finds solace away from Flair & Glory.","duration":43,"scws_id":142628,"season_id":2986,"created_at":"2023-05-18T13:30:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:39:10.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":0,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2023-05-18 15:30:37","images":[{"id":60172,"filename":"2d59a6f8-a780-4371-894a-cbebcbcab1a0.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":39251,"created_at":"2023-05-18T13:30:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T18:14:37.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/2d59a6f8-a780-4371-894a-cbebcbcab1a0.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":132970,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":39251,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Forgive, Maybe. Forget, Never."},{"id":132971,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":39251,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"A light at the end of the tunnel emerges as Alesha, Gus and Wanda finally get Stephen’s safe open, though Alesha is baffled by what she finds. On the back of Alesha’s discovery, Claudia rushes home. Together with Simon, Nina confronts Oyin. With the thief revealed, Nina goes after the culprit. Simon and Nina review Stephen’s will, while Maureen finds solace away from Flair & Glory."}]}],"path":"/it/titles/5906-riches-affari-di-famiglia/season-1","images":[]}],"info":{"id":5906,"name":"Riches - Affari di Famiglia","slug":"riches-affari-di-famiglia","plot":"Stephen Richards ha costruito un impero della cosmesi, ma quando viene colpito da un ictus, i segreti e le bugie della s